                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Noted.\r\nI recently started using nvim full time as my editor of choice. I was initially using `numToStr/Comment.nvim` and it provided support out of the box for all code files that I have used so far. Came to know of `mini.nvim` 1-2 weeks ago and incorporated the `mini.comment` plugin so I thought maybe it was plugin problem or something similar.\r\n\r\nThanks again",
